  "question": {
    "text": "The rate constant of a reaction increases by five times on increase in temperature from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>52</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The value of activation energy in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is&nbsp;___ .(Rounded-off to the nearest integer) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "52",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>325</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>or, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>325</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>or, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ea</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>325</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>52271</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>271</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math></p><p>Nearest integer answer will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>52</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math></p>",
